nd the environment.<br></li><li>Players can destroy environmental props by looking at them and pressing &quot;Q&quot;.<br></li><li>Players can examine varying objects around the game world for their relevant interaction information.<br></li><li>Players can access and move items around a rudimentary inventory system by pressing &quot;I&quot;.</li></ul>",
